      "item": "vegetable oil for frying",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unit": "cups"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "text": "Combine the flour and salt. Cut in the shortening until the mixture is crumbly, then stir in the milk to form a dough."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "text": "Combine the dried apricots, dried peaches, and sugar in a saucepan. Add water to cover, bring to a boil, and cook until the fruit is tender and the mixture is thickened. Drain if needed and let cool."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "text": "Roll the dough out and cut it into rounds. Place filling on each round, fold over, and press the edges firmly to seal."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "text": "Heat the vegetable oil for frying in a deep skillet or saucepan. Fry the pies in batches until golden on both sides."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "text": "Drain the fried pies on a rack or paper towels and serve warm."
    }
  ],
